{"seq":3,"slug":"later-years-and-jal","title":"晚年与重建日航","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/later-years-and-jal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kddi-and-second-venture","title":"创办第二电电","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/later-years-and-jal/kddi-and-second-venture","wordCount":1894,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"saving-japan-airlines","title":"拯救日本航空","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/later-years-and-jal/saving-japan-airlines","wordCount":2075,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"晚年与重建日航\">晚年与重建日航</h1><p>本章讲述稻盛和夫晚年开创新业与重建日航的传奇。在缔造京瓷之后，稻盛和夫又怀着造福国民的初心，创办了第二电电；晚年更是临危受命，奇迹般地拯救了破产的日本航空。两篇文档，分别呈现他创办第二电电的开拓，以及拯救日本航空的传奇。</p>\n"}